1
00:00:14,681 --> 00:00:17,934
The sun… It's dusk!

2
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,270
This can't be…

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:22,897
It must have started at that moment!

4
00:00:23,398 --> 00:00:26,901
The priest has been executing his ability
since he was in the Shuttle!

5
00:00:26,985 --> 00:00:29,946
All things are moving
at an incredible speed!

6
00:00:30,029 --> 00:00:31,656
Everything in this world,

7
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:36,327
not only man-made things,
but things in nature too!

8
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:38,872
The sun is already down!

9
00:00:38,955 --> 00:00:41,958
Is this his completed ability?

10
00:00:44,794 --> 00:00:46,087
Where is he?

11
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:47,672
Where did he go?

12
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:51,384
I can stop time for five seconds at most.

13
00:00:51,468 --> 00:00:55,722
In just five seconds,
I must find him and finish him off.

14
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:57,724
Time's up.

15
00:00:57,807 --> 00:00:59,309
Time will now start again…

16
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,394
What?

17
00:01:01,478 --> 00:01:03,897
No way. He's using the tree's flexibility!

18
00:01:25,168 --> 00:01:28,254
I will part with this last remark.

19
00:01:28,338 --> 00:01:30,006
Time will accelerate.

20
00:01:30,965 --> 00:01:36,721
I did not obtain this power
to end your lives,

21
00:01:36,805 --> 00:01:40,058
nor does this ability promise me
supreme strength.

22
00:01:41,226 --> 00:01:46,689
This power's purpose is to guide
the human race towards true happiness.

23
00:01:47,190 --> 00:01:51,444
My new Stand, my new ability.

24
00:01:52,153 --> 00:01:54,072
I shall give it a name.

25
00:01:54,572 --> 00:01:56,491
Maiden Heaven!

26
00:03:27,832 --> 00:03:31,002
EPISODE 37: MAIDEN HEAVEN (2)

27
00:03:31,085 --> 00:03:34,839
You're being eliminated
for the future I envision.

28
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:37,717
Your impending death

29
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:43,139
is merely a sacrifice
for humanity to achieve happiness.

30
00:03:46,017 --> 00:03:47,185
Gun ghost!

31
00:03:49,270 --> 00:03:50,730
It's useless, Emporio.

32
00:03:50,813 --> 00:03:52,315
Shooting him won't do any good.

33
00:03:52,398 --> 00:03:53,816
No, Jolyne.

34
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,860
I shot at the building near us!

35
00:03:56,569 --> 00:03:58,738
Ermes put her sticker on the bullet.

36
00:03:58,821 --> 00:04:01,115
The bullet is duplicated!

37
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:04,035
Emporio, you…

38
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:07,205
He's coming at us again!

39
00:04:07,288 --> 00:04:09,040
Hold on tight, everyone!

40
00:04:09,123 --> 00:04:11,542
No matter what, don't let go!

41
00:04:27,642 --> 00:04:30,186
It's him! He's chasing us on foot!

42
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:33,898
My Stand's speed is excluded
from the time acceleration!

43
00:04:33,982 --> 00:04:35,650
He'll catch up in no time!

44
00:04:35,733 --> 00:04:39,737
Emporio, put a sticker on the next bullet
and shoot again!

45
00:04:40,488 --> 00:04:42,573
We have to reach the swamp,

46
00:04:43,157 --> 00:04:44,284
to the ocean!

47
00:04:44,367 --> 00:04:48,788
If we're at the ocean,
then we might have a chance!

48
00:04:51,499 --> 00:04:53,501
The priest caught up to us!

49
00:04:53,584 --> 00:04:55,628
He's getting ahead to stand in our way!

50
00:04:56,421 --> 00:04:59,257
Shoot another bullet,
and change our direction, Emporio!

51
00:04:59,841 --> 00:05:02,552
It's the ocean!
I see the rocks in the swamp!

52
00:05:02,635 --> 00:05:06,306
Aim the next shot at
those protruding rocks!

53
00:05:14,647 --> 00:05:16,482
He's coming for us again!

54
00:05:16,566 --> 00:05:17,734
He's simply too fast!

55
00:05:17,817 --> 00:05:23,114
Listen closely.
He's moving with accelerated time,

56
00:05:23,197 --> 00:05:24,907
but one Stand is all he's got!

57
00:05:24,991 --> 00:05:28,494
Plus, its combat strength
is above average at best!

58
00:05:29,829 --> 00:05:33,499
He can only attack one of us at a time.

59
00:05:33,583 --> 00:05:36,336
That's the key to our victory.

60
00:05:36,919 --> 00:05:43,593
Jotaro, I'll send you a signal
the moment I get attacked.

61
00:05:43,676 --> 00:05:47,889
Seize that opportunity to stop time
and finish him off!

62
00:05:48,473 --> 00:05:54,270
The moment his attack hits me,
that's when you stop the time.

63
00:05:55,855 --> 00:05:56,689
Do you understand?

64
00:05:57,273 --> 00:06:00,193
Don't do it before I'm hit,
it has to be after.

65
00:06:00,276 --> 00:06:02,111
It'll be a split of a second.

66
00:06:02,695 --> 00:06:04,197
You must be absolutely precise.

67
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:06,365
Grab him and end his life.

68
00:06:06,449 --> 00:06:09,494
Our only chance is your Star Platinum!

69
00:06:10,203 --> 00:06:11,954
Wait a minute.

70
00:06:12,038 --> 00:06:13,498
We're doing what?

71
00:06:13,581 --> 00:06:16,751
I don't understand.

72
00:06:17,335 --> 00:06:19,462
Smart plan, Anastasia.

73
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:24,175
Although he proclaimed
that you are his first target,

74
00:06:24,258 --> 00:06:25,802
that may not be the case.

75
00:06:27,011 --> 00:06:30,973
It would make most sense
if he targeted me first.

76
00:06:31,557 --> 00:06:35,186
No, I've already submerged Diver Drive
into your body,

77
00:06:35,269 --> 00:06:38,856
so that it can protect you
from the inside.

78
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:40,817
You're not the only one.

79
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:43,319
Jolyne, Emporio, and Ermes too.

80
00:06:43,402 --> 00:06:47,240
Diver Drive has submerged into everyone
given our close distance.

81
00:06:47,323 --> 00:06:50,243
In other words, no matter
who gets attacked first,

82
00:06:51,077 --> 00:06:54,497
Diver Drive will feel the damage.

83
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:55,665
What?

84
00:06:55,748 --> 00:07:01,295
You will sense my signal
internally through Diver Drive.

85
00:07:01,379 --> 00:07:06,509
Remember, don't stop time
until after I'm hit.

86
00:07:07,135 --> 00:07:10,096
Anastasia, you're willing
to trade your life for his!

87
00:07:10,179 --> 00:07:11,597
That's absurd!

88
00:07:11,681 --> 00:07:14,517
His next attack will be deadly!

89
00:07:15,101 --> 00:07:16,269
Maybe so.

90
00:07:16,352 --> 00:07:20,940
But maybe I can signal Jotaro
before the blow kills me?

91
00:07:21,023 --> 00:07:23,192
I've been lucky recently.

92
00:07:23,276 --> 00:07:25,111
Wouldn't you say so, Emporio?

93
00:07:25,194 --> 00:07:28,573
I've been lucky since the jailbreak.
At least I haven't died yet!

94
00:07:28,656 --> 00:07:34,287
If I actually live through this,
I might even ask Jolyne to marry me!

95
00:07:37,373 --> 00:07:39,125
I'm just saying.

96
00:07:40,376 --> 00:07:41,210
That's fine by me.

97
00:07:45,089 --> 00:07:46,257
That's fine, Anastasia.

98
00:07:46,841 --> 00:07:48,301
Ask me to marry you.

99
00:07:48,926 --> 00:07:52,305
I'm not saying that
because I'm in despair at our situation.

100
00:07:53,306 --> 00:07:57,935
Your idea carries hope.
There's no darkness there.

101
00:07:58,019 --> 00:08:00,021
We may only have one chance.

102
00:08:00,104 --> 00:08:02,857
If there's even a glimpse of hope there,

103
00:08:02,940 --> 00:08:05,318
then I know it's the correct path for us.

104
00:08:10,615 --> 00:08:11,741
There he is!

105
00:08:11,824 --> 00:08:14,869
He's already on that rock! Emporio!

106
00:08:19,707 --> 00:08:21,292
Get close to me!

107
00:08:21,375 --> 00:08:23,252
You need to be closer!

108
00:08:25,379 --> 00:08:26,380
He's coming!

109
00:08:26,464 --> 00:08:28,132
Approaching from the right!

110
00:08:29,634 --> 00:08:30,843
Brace yourselves!

111
00:08:31,344 --> 00:08:37,266
This makes sense. The water gives him away
and tells us his position.

112
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:39,477
Not yet, Jotaro.

113
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:41,771
Don't stop time yet.

114
00:08:41,854 --> 00:08:44,190
If you miss him, it's over.

115
00:08:44,273 --> 00:08:46,734
You absolutely have to grab him!

116
00:08:46,817 --> 00:08:49,403
Feel my signal from within.

117
00:08:52,990 --> 00:08:55,243
Oh… wait.

118
00:08:55,326 --> 00:08:59,664
See that? Look at the clouds!

119
00:08:59,747 --> 00:09:02,416
They're zooming by like rockets!

120
00:09:02,917 --> 00:09:05,545
And what exactly is going on?

121
00:09:05,628 --> 00:09:07,505
The sky is brighter to the east!

122
00:09:09,966 --> 00:09:12,760
Why? It's still too early!

123
00:09:12,843 --> 00:09:15,721
It should take two or three minutes
for an hour to pass!

124
00:09:15,805 --> 00:09:19,850
That means it takes 20 to 30 minutes
for the night to pass.

125
00:09:19,934 --> 00:09:21,269
I don't believe this!

126
00:09:21,352 --> 00:09:24,188
The sun is rising
at an unbelievable speed!

127
00:09:29,026 --> 00:09:34,448
Time is accelerating faster than before!

128
00:09:35,408 --> 00:09:38,578
Around the world, birds are flying
at their normal speed.

129
00:09:39,161 --> 00:09:41,372
Similarly, insects and plants
haven't changed their speed.

130
00:09:41,455 --> 00:09:47,545
Flowers aren't blooming faster,
nor are they wilting in an instant.

131
00:09:47,628 --> 00:09:48,963
Look closely.

132
00:09:49,046 --> 00:09:51,382
I have a glass cup in my hand.

133
00:09:51,465 --> 00:09:55,511
When the cup is in my hand,
nothing happens to it.

134
00:09:55,595 --> 00:09:58,931
But the moment I let go,

135
00:10:00,141 --> 00:10:02,727
the cup falls faster than we can see.

136
00:10:02,810 --> 00:10:06,105
It's shattered on the ground
before we realize it.

137
00:10:06,188 --> 00:10:10,234
The only logical explanation
is the acceleration of time!

138
00:10:10,818 --> 00:10:15,489
Everything in the universe is
accelerating except for living things!

139
00:10:16,574 --> 00:10:18,618
This is all my assistants' fault!

140
00:10:18,701 --> 00:10:21,203
I'm the top-selling manga artist!

141
00:10:22,246 --> 00:10:25,291
A genius like me drawing
no more than one page a night?

142
00:10:25,374 --> 00:10:26,292
That's absurd!

143
00:10:29,754 --> 00:10:33,591
The ink dries before
I can draw a single line!

144
00:10:33,674 --> 00:10:35,801
What in the world am I supposed to do?

145
00:10:38,095 --> 00:10:39,597
Hello?

146
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:42,266
What? One artist is still
meeting deadlines?

147
00:10:42,350 --> 00:10:44,644
Who is he?

148
00:10:44,727 --> 00:10:46,270
Who the hell is he?

149
00:10:46,771 --> 00:10:47,772
It's Rohan Kishibe.

150
00:10:47,855 --> 00:10:49,148
What?

151
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:53,319
I can't see the waves
because of the accelerated time!

152
00:10:53,402 --> 00:10:55,988
We can't tell where he is!

153
00:10:56,072 --> 00:10:58,616
Where will he ambush us from?

154
00:11:01,077 --> 00:11:02,870
Get ready!

155
00:11:02,953 --> 00:11:04,955
Stone Ocean!

156
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:06,916
Smack!

157
00:11:06,999 --> 00:11:10,628
Jotaro, hold off on your ability.

158
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:12,380
Wait for my signal!

159
00:11:18,969 --> 00:11:20,346
Now! Stop the time--

160
00:11:20,429 --> 00:11:22,723
Star Platinum: The World!

161
00:11:27,395 --> 00:11:29,146
You're mine!

162
00:11:29,230 --> 00:11:30,648
Meet your end, Pucchi--

163
00:11:35,945 --> 00:11:37,321
How is this possible?

164
00:11:37,405 --> 00:11:40,991
Pucchi made Jolyne's Stand
attack Anastasia!

165
00:11:41,075 --> 00:11:43,202
I'm one step behind!

166
00:11:47,289 --> 00:11:48,541
Four seconds left.

167
00:11:49,250 --> 00:11:51,710
If I don't kill him now,

168
00:11:51,794 --> 00:11:54,380
he'll vanish
in the accelerated time again.

169
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:57,550
It'll be over if time starts again!

170
00:11:58,134 --> 00:12:01,512
I must end this fight
before time restarts!

171
00:12:02,096 --> 00:12:03,472
Three seconds left.

172
00:12:04,181 --> 00:12:05,641
Two seconds!

173
00:12:22,783 --> 00:12:24,827
Knives, suspended in air!

174
00:12:25,327 --> 00:12:29,957
The priest had already thrown the knives,
just as Dio once did!

175
00:12:43,262 --> 00:12:45,931
You were two steps behind.

176
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:52,980
STAND NAME: MAIDEN HEAVEN
STAND MASTER: ENRICO PUCCHI

177
00:13:00,529 --> 00:13:04,366
The Joestar family,
through their bloodline,

178
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:09,580
have seized victories by
drawing strength from honor and courage.

179
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:11,373
However!

180
00:13:11,457 --> 00:13:14,210
Your bloodline is also your weakness.

181
00:13:14,793 --> 00:13:19,173
Jotaro Kujo,
your weakness is your daughter.

182
00:13:37,566 --> 00:13:39,318
Dad…

183
00:13:40,361 --> 00:13:42,029
Jolyne…

184
00:13:43,531 --> 00:13:45,699
I stole a car…

185
00:13:45,783 --> 00:13:48,452
on the way home from school…

186
00:13:49,537 --> 00:13:52,289
at a supermarket parking lot…

187
00:13:52,873 --> 00:13:57,086
I stole a car… Why did I do that?

188
00:13:59,171 --> 00:14:03,175
But… I knew that you'd come and save me.

189
00:14:03,842 --> 00:14:10,140
You'd do whatever it takes… to save me…

190
00:14:10,683 --> 00:14:12,351
Dad, you…

191
00:14:27,908 --> 00:14:31,954
I must bring all loose ends to a close.

192
00:14:32,037 --> 00:14:37,042
I do not feel remorse,
nor can I let you run freely.

193
00:14:37,126 --> 00:14:39,128
I must settle every matter.

194
00:14:39,211 --> 00:14:42,965
After all, I am the one
who killed your mother.

195
00:14:43,048 --> 00:14:44,091
Emporio.

196
00:14:52,266 --> 00:14:53,684
Yes, shoot.

197
00:14:54,351 --> 00:14:57,813
At least you may die a martyr's death.

198
00:15:00,774 --> 00:15:04,612
Your fate ends here, Emporio!

199
00:15:20,085 --> 00:15:21,712
Jolyne Kujo!

200
00:15:24,715 --> 00:15:26,550
Ah!

201
00:15:31,513 --> 00:15:34,516
Joestar!

202
00:15:36,393 --> 00:15:38,520
Do you think you can escape me?

203
00:15:38,604 --> 00:15:42,775
You swim even slower than you run.

204
00:15:50,157 --> 00:15:51,492
Jolyne!

205
00:15:51,575 --> 00:15:54,328
I caught a dolphin with Stone Ocean.

206
00:15:54,828 --> 00:16:00,125
Yes, time may be accelerating,
but living things are unaffected.

207
00:16:00,209 --> 00:16:03,629
Now, Father Pucchi…
you're against this speed!

208
00:16:03,712 --> 00:16:06,548
How long will it take for you to catch up?

209
00:16:06,632 --> 00:16:08,550
The distance is at play here.

210
00:16:08,634 --> 00:16:10,386
Had we been closer,
you may have been able to catch up.

211
00:16:10,469 --> 00:16:14,306
But how far can you swim?

212
00:16:14,390 --> 00:16:17,476
Is it 500 meters, or 800?

213
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:19,478
Can you stay underwater

214
00:16:19,561 --> 00:16:22,690
and swim longer than a dolphin
without letting out?

215
00:16:22,773 --> 00:16:24,692
Time acceleration doesn't affect

216
00:16:24,775 --> 00:16:29,321
the distance you can swim,
or the stamina that you have!

217
00:16:29,405 --> 00:16:33,575
Moreover, can you swim this distance
back to shore without drowning?

218
00:16:34,451 --> 00:16:36,495
You will not escape!

219
00:16:36,578 --> 00:16:38,747
I shall end your life!

220
00:16:39,581 --> 00:16:42,543
I refuse to carry this feud
into the future!

221
00:16:43,168 --> 00:16:44,878
Jolyne, the rope!

222
00:16:44,962 --> 00:16:46,797
Hurry, come to the dolphin!

223
00:16:47,881 --> 00:16:49,091
Emporio…

224
00:16:49,591 --> 00:16:53,345
Because Anastasia sacrificed himself
to protect my father,

225
00:16:53,429 --> 00:16:56,223
I'm still alive, though barely.

226
00:16:57,558 --> 00:17:00,394
Because Ermes gave her life
to attack the priest,

227
00:17:00,477 --> 00:17:03,772
I had enough time
to grab onto the dolphin.

228
00:17:04,356 --> 00:17:06,442
When a dolphin lets a human ride
on its back,

229
00:17:06,525 --> 00:17:09,153
it swims to shore
in the safest way possible.

230
00:17:09,236 --> 00:17:10,821
Hurry, please!

231
00:17:10,904 --> 00:17:12,322
Come!

232
00:17:12,406 --> 00:17:14,867
Why is the rope getting longer?

233
00:17:15,451 --> 00:17:20,581
That dolphin will take you to safety.
I know it will.

234
00:17:21,832 --> 00:17:25,544
What are you saying? Hurry and join me!

235
00:17:25,627 --> 00:17:28,255
Emporio, I can't join you.

236
00:17:28,756 --> 00:17:32,259
The priest can sense the Joestar in me.

237
00:17:32,342 --> 00:17:37,347
No matter where I go, I sense him,
and he senses me to track me down.

238
00:17:39,683 --> 00:17:42,102
If I'm with you, you can't get away.

239
00:17:44,188 --> 00:17:49,151
Emporio, you have to face
the path that lies ahead alone.

240
00:17:49,943 --> 00:17:51,361
But don't worry.

241
00:17:51,445 --> 00:17:53,739
I know you can finish
what we set out to do.

242
00:17:54,323 --> 00:17:58,452
Those who wished for your escape
were Anastasia, Ermes,

243
00:17:58,535 --> 00:18:02,623
and my father, Jotaro Kujo.

244
00:18:03,874 --> 00:18:06,710
You have to survive. You are our hope.

245
00:18:06,794 --> 00:18:09,797
I told you, I don't understand!

246
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,715
No, you can't…

247
00:18:12,341 --> 00:18:15,219
Stop, wait! Jolyne!

248
00:18:15,302 --> 00:18:17,262
No!

249
00:18:17,346 --> 00:18:20,724
Pull the rope!

250
00:18:23,352 --> 00:18:24,603
He ought to be tired out by now.

251
00:18:25,395 --> 00:18:27,189
I'll hold him off!

252
00:18:32,194 --> 00:18:34,363
Face me, Father Pucchi!

253
00:18:37,407 --> 00:18:39,535
Stone Ocean!

254
00:18:47,126 --> 00:18:51,380
Jolyne!

255
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,924
What's that in the sky?

256
00:18:54,007 --> 00:18:55,425
Could that be the sun?

257
00:18:55,509 --> 00:18:58,303
It's already morning!

258
00:18:58,387 --> 00:19:02,808
The sun isn't round.
It looks like it's stretching out!

259
00:19:03,392 --> 00:19:05,185
The needles on my watch vanished…

260
00:19:05,269 --> 00:19:09,565
No, it's ticking so fast,
I can't see them with my eyes!

261
00:19:10,149 --> 00:19:11,525
It's night time again.

262
00:19:11,608 --> 00:19:12,901
Morning!

263
00:19:12,985 --> 00:19:14,111
It's night again!

264
00:19:14,194 --> 00:19:15,362
What's happening?

265
00:19:15,445 --> 00:19:16,280
It's accelerating.

266
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:19,283
Time is accelerating even more!

267
00:19:20,742 --> 00:19:22,536
Oh, damn!

268
00:19:23,162 --> 00:19:24,329
We need canned foods!

269
00:19:24,413 --> 00:19:26,582
Raw foods are rotting away.

270
00:19:26,665 --> 00:19:29,543
Hoard whatever canned food you can find!

271
00:19:29,626 --> 00:19:31,461
We're running out of food!

272
00:19:31,545 --> 00:19:35,507
Dust is collecting!
The window frames are rusting!

273
00:19:51,106 --> 00:19:52,482
My implants!

274
00:19:52,566 --> 00:19:56,195
I just got these done the other day!

275
00:19:58,739 --> 00:20:01,074
What is happening to the sky?

276
00:20:01,158 --> 00:20:03,160
Where's the sun?

277
00:20:03,243 --> 00:20:05,871
Is that gleaming light the sun?

278
00:20:05,954 --> 00:20:09,166
Is it night, or is it day?
What year are we in?

279
00:20:09,249 --> 00:20:11,543
What is today's date?

280
00:20:11,627 --> 00:20:13,503
I feel cold.

281
00:20:14,046 --> 00:20:15,839
The seasons are changing!

282
00:20:19,218 --> 00:20:21,303
What is that?

283
00:20:21,386 --> 00:20:23,639
The waves are eroding the rocks away!

284
00:20:24,806 --> 00:20:27,142
Is there no way to stop
time from accelerating?

285
00:20:27,226 --> 00:20:28,560
How much more?

286
00:20:28,644 --> 00:20:31,146
Is there an end to this?

287
00:20:45,702 --> 00:20:48,330
The land formation changed!

288
00:20:55,545 --> 00:20:57,673
Where am I?

289
00:20:57,756 --> 00:21:00,384
There are only live organisms here!

290
00:21:08,809 --> 00:21:10,560
I can't breathe…

291
00:21:35,127 --> 00:21:40,549
What the hell? Why are you naked here?

292
00:21:40,632 --> 00:21:42,426
Huh? But I was just…

293
00:21:43,260 --> 00:21:44,636
Hurry up!

294
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:46,722
Put your jumpsuits on!

295
00:21:46,805 --> 00:21:48,974
Why don't I have clothes on?

296
00:21:49,057 --> 00:21:53,186
Wait… what was I doing?
Time got faster and I…

297
00:21:53,270 --> 00:21:55,230
Crap! I'm on camera!

298
00:21:55,314 --> 00:21:56,440
It's going to get misunderstood!

299
00:21:58,275 --> 00:22:00,193
This is…

300
00:22:01,528 --> 00:22:02,571
This place…

301
00:22:04,072 --> 00:22:06,825
I know where this is!

302
00:22:08,577 --> 00:22:11,163
This is Green Dolphin Street Prison!

303
00:22:11,246 --> 00:22:14,958
This is the hallway
by the visitation room!

304
00:23:41,128 --> 00:23:46,133
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
